Apoorv Mittal resolved KAFKA-19389.
-----------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> High memory consumption for completed share fetch requests
> ----------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-19389
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19389
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Sub-task
>    Affects Versions: 4.1.0
>            Reporter: Apoorv Mittal
>            Assignee: Apoorv Mittal
>            Priority: Critical
>             Fix For: 4.1.0
>
>
> This problem can cause broker OOM if tiered storage is used and a backlog of records is present to be consumed. It only occurs if there is no concurrent producing of records, because this activity has the side-effect of causing the memory to be released more promptly.



