Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-19406:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Remove BrokerTopicStats#removeOldFollowerMetrics
                 Key: KAFKA-19406
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19406
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


The method is used to remove `ReplicationBytesInPerSec` and `ReassignmentBytesInPerSec` from specific topic. However, since both `ReplicationBytesInPerSec` and `ReassignmentBytesInPerSec` apply across all topics, their removal from a specific topic is always a no-op.



