Hi Team,
Good Day!

We are currently in the process of migrating data from our existing Kafka c=
luster to a new one, As part of this transition we are using MirrorMaker 2 =
to replicate data between the old and new Kafka servers.

However, we are encountering a critical issue with MirrorMaker 2 is shuttin=
g down unexpectedly during data processing, and the following error is bein=
g logged,
We tried with all required parameters under connect MirrorMaker connector b=
ut followed issue persisting.
Error logs:
ERROR [MirrorSourceConnector|task-0] WorkerSourceTask{id=3DMirrorSourceConn=
ector-0} failed to send record to eps.leaf.logs:  (org.apache.kafka.connect=
.runtime.AbstractWorkerSourceTask:422)
org.apache.kafka.common.errors.RecordTooLargeException: The message is 1850=
356 bytes when serialized which is larger than 1048576, which is the value =
of the max.request.size configuration.

We would appreciate your assistance in reviewing this error and helping us =
resolve the issue as a priority, as it is impacting our data pipeline betwe=
en Kafka and the ELK stack.
Please let us know if you need any additional logs or configuration details=
 to assist with troubleshooting.

Looking forward to your prompt support.

Thanks & Regards,
___________________________________________________________________
