>  # [ConsumerGroupInstallAssignment|https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-848%3A+The+Next+Generation+of+the+Consumer+Rebalance+Protocol#KIP848:TheNextGenerationoftheConsumerRebalanceProtocol-ConsumerGroupInstallAssignmentAPI]
> Support for ConsumerGroupHeartbeat is handled by KAFKA-15278. This task is to implement the ConsumerGroupAssignmentRequestManager to handle the second and third RPCs on the above list.
> This task is part of the work to implement support for the new KIP-848 consumer group protocol.



