I have some nits - it may be useful to

a) group all the KIP email threads in the main one (just a bunch of links to =
everything)
b) create the email threads

It's a bit hard to track it all - for example, I was searching for a discuss =
thread for KIP-1165 for a while; As far as I can tell, it doesn't exist yet.

Since the KIPs are published (by virtue of having the root KIP be published, =
having a DISCUSS thread and links to sub-KIPs where were aimed to move the di=
scussion towards), I think it would be good to create DISCUSS threads for the=
m all.

Best,
Stan

