Andrew Schofield created KAFKA-19437:
----------------------------------------

             Summary: Review incidence of null metadata image in share coordinator
                 Key: KAFKA-19437
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19437
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
    Affects Versions: 4.1.0
            Reporter: Andrew Schofield
            Assignee: Sushant Mahajan
             Fix For: 4.2.0


We've seen very occasional situations where a null metadata image seems to be presented in the share coordinator which then causes inter-broker RPC validation to fail. We should dig in further and resolve.



